<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
            <!-- Technical Requirements -->
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  
    <!-- Primary SEO Tags -->
    <title>Testimonial-Cards</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Testimonials">
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://example.com">
  
    <!-- Robots Control (Optional) -->
    <meta name="robots" content="index, follow">
  
     <!-- Social Media Previews -->
    <meta property="og:title" content="Testimonial-Cards">
    <meta property="og:description" content="Testimonials">
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://example.com">
    <title>Testimonial-Cards</title>
    <style>
        .container {
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px; /* Space between the boxes */
        }

        .box {
            flex: 1; /* Makes all boxes equal width */
            padding: 8px;
            background-color: transparent; 
        }

        .comment-bubble {
            position: relative;
            background: black;
            color: white;
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-family: sans-serif;
            margin-bottom: 20px; /* Replaces unstable <br> tags for spacing */
        }

        /* Creates the little triangle shape at the bottom of the bubble */
        .comment-bubble::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -10px; /* Positions the triangle at the bottom */
            left: 30px; /* Positions the triangle horizontally */
            border-width: 10px 10px 0; /* Creates the triangle shape */
            border-style: solid;
            border-color: black transparent; /* Matches the bubble color */
            display: block;
            width: 0;
        }

        /* Profile alignment styling */
        .profile-section {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .profile-image {
            width: 50px;
            height: 50px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .profile-info .name {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-family: sans-serif;
        }

        .profile-info .role {
            margin: 2px 0 0 0;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #888888;
            font-family: sans-serif;
        }
        .container1 {
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px; /* Space between the boxes */
        }

        .box1 {
            flex: 1; /* Makes all boxes equal width */
            padding: 5px;
            background-color: black; 
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <!-- Card 1 -->
        <div class="box">
            <div class="comment-bubble">
                I have been solving all the project ideas on roadmap.sh and I am surprised how far I have come from where I started. <br><br> Highly recommended! 
            </div> 
            <div class="profile-section">
                <img src="IMG_20261007_230722.jpg" class="profile-image" alt="Artem Jones">
                <div class="profile-info">
                    <h4 class="name">Artem Jones</h4>
                    <p class="role">Junior Frontend Developer</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 2 (Fixed to mirror Card 1) -->
        <div class="box">
           <div style="border:2px solid black; padding:15px;border-radius:8px;">
                Since starting my career in 2021, I have only followed one resource, roadmap.sh, it truly help me go from 0 to having a job and changing the financial trajectory of my family.
            <br>
            <div class="profile-section">
                <img src="IMG_20261007_230722.jpg" class="profile-image" alt="Artem Jones">
                <div class="profile-info">
                    <h4 class="name">Artem Jones</h4>
                    <p class="role">Junior Frontend Developer</p>
                </div>
               </div>
            </div>             
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="container1">
    <img src="IMG_20261007_230722.jpg" width="130px" height="130px" border-radius="8px">
    <div class="box1">
         <p style="color:white;font-size:12px;">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐<br><b>Jackie Mackle</b><br><span style="color:grey;font-size:10px;">Engineering Manager</span><br><br>I find myself recommending roadmap.sh to all the internees or junior developers. It's a great way to skill up and grow in your career.</p>
         </div>
    </div>
    </div>
    </div>
    <br>
    <div style="border:2px solid black;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;">
         roadmap.sh is an incredible resource. I was fortunate to discover it during my university days in 2018. Back then, it was just a single repository with three images. It's amazing to see how much impact it has had on milliona of lives since then.
    </div>
</body>
</html>
